+# The dummy video driver, on every platform. SDL uses it when no real backend
+# can open a display, and without it a headless run -- CI, a dedicated server,
+# an automated test -- cannot start at all: SDL_Init(SDL_INIT_VIDEO) fails with
+# "dummy not available" even when SDL_VIDEO_DRIVER=dummy is set explicitly.
+# The port compiled only Wayland here, so there was no fallback of any kind.
+cdata.set('SDL_VIDEO_DRIVER_DUMMY', 1)
+subdir('dummy')
